column2:
Base: Unleash a cutting shockwave
along the ground. A base arte can
be connected from a regular attack.{END}

Base: Fry an enemy with a
bolt of lightning and finish
with a downward slash.{END}

Base: Soar into enemies while
enveloped in the flames of the
legendary bird.{END}

Base: Bash an enemy with your
shield and spin around to finish
with a mighty thrust.{END}

Base: Halt the enemy with an
energy barrier and slice them
up with an aura wave.{END}

Base: Create a distortion enlarging
your weapon and cleave the enemy
in two with a down slash.{END}

Create a void to extend attack range
and deliver a devasting horizontal
slice to the enemy.{END}

Implant your weapon into the
ground to create a barrier of
light that repels the enemy.{END}

A deadly multi-hit combo attack.
Requires a manually-inputted sequence
of button presses to perform in full.{END}

Arcane: A combination of Demon Fang
and Swallow Dance. An arcane arte
can be connected from a base arte.{END}

Arcane: A combination of
Lightning Tiger Blade and
Swallow Dance.{END}

Arcane: A combination of
Lightning Tiger Blade
and Sword Rain: Alpha.{END}

Intermediate/Fire: Molten rock
jets from the ground and returns
as large fire balls.{END}

Grandmaster/Fire: Drop a magic bomb
with a wide blast radius at the
target's feet.{END}

Intermediate/Water: Conjure a
frigid vortex to pelt the enemy
with blocks of ice.{END}

Advanced/Earth: Crush the enemy
with a swarm of sizable rocks
and finish with a giant boulder.{END}

Summon the Spirit of Wind.
Governor of one of the
Four Great Elements.{END}

Summon the Spirit of Water.
Governor of one of the
Four Great Elements.{END}

Summon the Spirit of Earth.
Governor of one of the
Four Great Elements.{END}

Summon the Spirit of Fire.
Governor of one of the
Four Great Elements.{END}
